<p>Strus’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$26.5m</strong>, taken from his <strong>$66.2m</strong> in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him.</p>
<p>He played three seasons at Lewis University, a small school in Illinois, before transferring to DePaul. He went undrafted in 2019 and signed six contracts in his first four years in the league.</p>

