<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/max-strus/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/max-strus/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Max Strus’s Salary in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Strus earns $16.66m in 2026-27, third on the Clippers payroll and the last year of his contract. It rises from $15.94m last season. His career earnings come to $66.2m across eight seasons. The salary is 9.21% of the club’s $180.92m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Max Strus Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The contract expires at the end of this season and he becomes an unrestricted free agent in 2027 at 31. A shooter of that age usually signs for three or four more years."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Max Strus Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $16.66m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Does Max Strus’s Contract With the Clippers Include?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Strus is in the final season of the four-year contract worth $62.3m that he signed in a sign-and-trade from Miami to Cleveland on July 6, 2023, fully guaranteed. It has paid him about $15.57m a season. He becomes an unrestricted free agent in 2027 at 31."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Max Strus’s Estimated Net Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Strus’s net worth is estimated at around $26.5m, taken from his $66.2m in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him. He played three seasons at Lewis University, a small school in Illinois, before transferring to DePaul. He went undrafted in 2019 and signed six contracts in his first four years in the league."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is Max Strus Paid $16.66m After His Trade?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Strus is paid $16.66m because he shoots from distance in volume and a club over the cap has to pay that price to acquire it. His first NBA season paid him $415k. This one pays forty times that."}}]}</script>
